  "description": "We are moving the right direction...but...",
  "body_html": "<p>Hope everyone had a great Thanksgiving, and if you do not celebrate, well, hope you had a great week nonetheless. Taking a glance at several of our core signals for investing, unfortunately, I am not seeing anything screaming “go full portfolio now!”</p><p>The S&amp;P 500 futures needs to reclaim $6900.50, AND hold before considering any new positions. This will demonstrate that the bulls are back in charge again and can overwhelm sellers. Additionally, seeing “recession resistant” stocks like silver lead the pumps is not a great signal. Finally, crypto (particularly Bitcoin) will LAG the bull markets, but LEAD the bear markets. Bitcoin ran up slightly, and then took a dump. </p><p>I wish I had better news coming back…but the market is going to do what the market wants to do. Until I see better signals, I remain in the mindset of PROTECTING CAPITAL. Do not kill your portfolio trying to force trades that are not working. As always, I will keep you updated. </p><p><strong>Watch the video… everything is in there. It’s 3 minutes, you will survive. Then like and re-stack this post. Thanks! </strong></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mmcZ!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F29b3ce9f-3ecf-48a8-8b35-4a91ebb793fe_1880x921.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mmcZ!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F29b3ce9f-3ecf-48a8-8b35-4a91ebb793fe_1880x921.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mmcZ!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F29b3ce9f-3ecf-48a8-8b35-4a91